// Who exists, and where they come from. Every `house_id` must name a house in
// houses.ron — checked after all mods have merged, so another mod may supply
// the house.
//
// Ages and treasuries change in play, so they are state: start.state.ron.
//
// Family ties (parent↔child, husband↔wife) live in families.ron.
//
// Each character carries a `skills` block (martial / prowess / treasury /
// prudence / intrigue / faith), all 0..=20. The values here are the authored
// baseline; a state overlay may replace them so future traits can drift a
// stat without breaking the definition.
//
// Distribution target (mod-wide): mean ~10, std-dev ~4, with 19-20 reserved
// for legendary rulers and 2-4 for the clearly weak. The range 0..=20 lets
// the AI monthly formulas have headroom — see docs/skills.md (TODO).
(
    characters: [
        // House Cresswell — Aldric rules Westmarch; Mara is his wife.
